:false,"text":"クラウン家の人間は代々魅了魔法を得意とする。魔法を唱えなくとも「血」その物が人を引き付ける効果を持っていて、その能力ゆえにクラウン家はハイクイーンに最も近い一族となっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16922","sourceWorkId":"25187","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"スリーサイズ：ボンキュッボン"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味：刺繍　 得意魔法：魅了魔法"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラウン家の人間は代々 魅了魔法 を得意とし、魔法を唱えなくとも"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“血”そのものが人を引き付ける効果を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため人に好かれることは当たり前で、主人公に対しても同じだった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし自身の愛が深まっていくにつれ、彼の想いが自分の能力によって"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"捻じ曲げられたものなのではないかと不安になり、悩むことになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「初めてなんです、こんな気持ち。 あなたに愛して貰う為に、セレアは生まれたのですわ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55741"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55741","value":"刺繍"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/42d4ddb5c01f4b65a74fa3d0e317f59d76096650979f2ce4eb55460843207c1d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cf1d823de4c0dd652f2ab05a38d1ebaa0e447678b76fa96ac30ed9a0b5023cd9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"拝師みほ","creatorId":"vndb:s9111","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s9111","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9111","name":"拝師 みほ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:213198:55741:29704:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c61793","characterName":"ファティ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"55742","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"213198"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16923"],"vndbCharacterId":"c61793"},"originalCharacterName":"ファティ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"はるか昔、３国がまだ争い合いハイクイーン制がなかった時代。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スワロー家は動物を使った諜報活動で情報を集めていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"中でも鳥をよく使い、敵国で見てきた事を鳥たちに喋らせていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ハイクイーン制が生まれてからは諜報活動はしていないが、動物と会話する魔法はスワロー家の最も得意とする魔法として残っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし現在の平和な大陸では諜報活動用の魔法は大した力を持つ事が出来ない為、スワロー家は常に貧しく没落寸前である。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16923","sourceWorkId":"25187","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"スリーサイズ：ぽんきゅっぽん"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味：動物観察　 得意魔法：動物と話す"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"動物と意思を通わせ操り、それによる諜報を得意としていたスワロー王家の末裔。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"平和な時代を迎えたことで活躍の機会は減り、没落寸前となってしまっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"貧しいため身の回りのことは大抵自分ででき、家事能力は高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし魔法能力はイマイチで、間違えて自分に猫耳を生やしてしまうこともある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「小鳥が教えてくれたの。 ハンバーグが好き、なんだよね？　早速作ってみました♪　えへへっ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55742"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55742","value":"動物観察"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/94c6050d63e40eba3119f3838dd5ccae6127c95aa969be7175ddcee144fac38b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e3fab1f4387fa9a52476b57a29ff711c386a772ad178d2dfd47cb55c446f7a43.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"木ノ実 なみ","creatorId":"vndb:s10759","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10759","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10759","name":"木ノ実 なみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:73846","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c61794","characterName":"リアン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"55743","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"213198"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16924"],"vndbCharacterId":"c61794"},"originalCharacterName":"リアン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"はるか昔の大戦での経験を元に、魔法で荒れた大地や、形を変えられた物を元に戻す魔法を研究した王国の王女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その魔法技術が認められ、スケール家は大陸の最高裁判所を持ち、そこでは公正な裁判が行われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ファティの魔法の失敗もよく中和している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16924","sourceWorkId":"25187","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"スリーサイズ：ボンキュッボォォーーーン！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味：読書　 得意魔法：魔術によって変容したものを元に戻す中和魔法"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大戦時の魔法で荒れた大地や物を元に戻す魔法の研究を行った王国の王女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その功績が認められ、大陸の最高裁判所を任されて公正な裁判を行っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ファティの魔法の失敗もよく中和している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何事も中立の立場であろうとするが、主人公に心惹かれてしまい……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ど、どこを触っている!? 裁くぞっ!!」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55743"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55743","value":"読書"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/508018158e0e8494ab230fae8393c6ba6945c2b477ebee70724f7d0b9e5cefbe.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cdaa3baf8cd7cf38bcfc3cbd768d62bfae79111a10ce3d0a693888bcf0a70c12.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"櫻井菜々絵","creatorId":"vndb:s6525","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6525","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6525","name":"櫻井 菜々絵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:213198:55743:19126:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c61795","characterName":"若王子 環","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"55744","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"213198"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16925"],"vndbCharacterId":"c61795"},"originalCharacterName":"若王子 環","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"男装の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供の頃見た「王子と姫の物語」に影響され、王子になる事を夢見る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「なんで姫じゃなくて王子なのかって？ だって姫は王子が来るのを待ってなくちゃいけないだろ？ ボクはそんなのは嫌だ」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"たっぷりのレースやふわふわフリルいっぱいのお洋服に、可愛い女の子が身を包んでいるのを見るのが大好き。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16925","sourceWorkId":"25187","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"スリーサイズ：ひみつ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味：王子や姫の出てくる物語に触れること"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男装している女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供の頃に見た 『王子と姫の物語』 に影響され、王子になることを夢見ている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「なんで姫じゃなくて王子なのかって？　だって姫は"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"王子が来るのを待ってなくちゃいけないだろ？ ボクはそんなのは嫌だ」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可愛い女の子がたっぷりのレースやふわふわフリルいっぱいのお洋服に身を包んでいるのを見るのが大好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「そもそもボクには似合わないしっ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55744"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55744","value":"王子や姫の出てくる物語に触れること"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fd1681bf21d7a3c302fe0626e1148a83b09f3672a5f04e59674d7ac5953cc694.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/16/162b52352941f75558c0f5200139605918e1bff7090cd815633494da6b2fb8cc.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"明島ゆうり","creatorId":"vndb:s3891","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3891","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3891","name":"赤井リア(赤井いちご)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:213198:55744:13367:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c61796","characterName":"霊群 みえる","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"55745","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"213198"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16926"],"vndbCharacterId":"c61796"},"originalCharacterName":"霊群 みえる","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"無口なクラスメイトだが、彼女の占いは当たると評判で同級生だけでなく上級生や下級生も占いの依頼にやってくるほど。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"霊感に鋭く王女達の使う魔法も普通の人間には見えないはずだが、彼女には何故だかわずかに見えてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「……今、何をしたの？」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"みえるの鋭い指摘に大和はいつもタジタジだ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16926","sourceWorkId":"25187","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"スリーサイズ：ぺたんこ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味：占い"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口数の少ないクラスメイト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味の占いはよく当たると評判で、学年を問わず依頼にやってくるほど。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また霊感があり、なぜか王女たちの使う魔法もわずかに見えてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女の鋭い指摘に、主人公はいつもタジタジ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「……今、何をしたの？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55745"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55745","value":"占い"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/69/697c618bd9012f3f89659169f7d1be71c6f78bb1fbe349397eb230fbe1760662.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3a1b167038c8f3d7dff5493911c124a97f3f37b298f2520c64dd5a7a74ac6290.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"眞田朱音","creatorId":"vndb:s610","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s610","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s610","name":"眞田 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:213198:55745:5928:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c62392","characterName":"飯伏 大和","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"55746","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"213198"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16928"],"vndbCharacterId":"c62392"},"originalCharacterName":"飯伏 大和","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"180"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親が謎の失踪をし、大きな家で一人で住んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は明るく前向き。お年寄りや子ども、女子に優しいイケメンだが彼女はまだ居ない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"寂しいと思う気持ちはいつか彼女が出来れば解消されると自分に言い聞かせている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16928","sourceWorkId":"25187","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"身長：180cm　 趣味：TVドラマ、映画"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親が謎の失踪をしてしまい、大きな家に一人で住んでいる学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は明るく前向き。 お年寄りや子供、女子に優しいイケメンだが彼女はまだいない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"寂しいと思う気持ちは、いつか彼女ができれば解消されると自分に言い聞かせている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55746"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55746","value":"TVドラマ、映画"},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"180 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16928","sourceWorkId":"25187","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c62396","characterName":"ジェカーラナシー クラウン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"55788","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"213198"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16927"],"vndbCharacterId":"c62396"},"originalCharacterName":"ジェカーラナシー クラウン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"剣と魔法の世界ランスロール大陸。大陸はクラウン王国、スワロー王国、スケール王国、の三国に分かれていて、ハイクイーンは大陸全土の代表者であり統治者。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16927","sourceWorkId":"25187","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"三国に分かれるランスロール大陸の絶対統治者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女の統治により平穏は保たれているが、“魔王の卵”と呼ばれる災害が"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"近く起こることを知り、三国の王女たちに異世界での特殊な任務と呪いを与える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あなた達の中から次代のハイクイーンを選びます」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55788"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e8/e819412d4d6838ae7e6d6f9d8a52087aaf641be04c2507d412846f352d6e1a47.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/78617f46297eba8ee9d8154e99d5688d4d60aa12d56cc1d4b1c3ca8eb32bfd60.webp","width":256,"height":181,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田中理々","creatorId":"vndb:s1977","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1977","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1977","name":"田中 理々","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:213198:55788:17081:1","source":"bangumi"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p6839","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:5410","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p6839","name":"おもちそふと","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:25187:5410","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p6839","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p6839","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p6839","name":"おもちそふと","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:129682:v21121","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p6839","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p6839","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p6839","name":"おもちそふと","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:58452:v21121","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p6839","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p6839","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p6839","name":"おもちそふと","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:60232:v21121","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p6839","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p6839","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p6839","name":"おもちそふと","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-